	(text "The I/O card V1.2, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Bus and ports THE BUS, THE DATA BUFFER, THE PORT DECODE, THE STROBES, THE CONTROL LATCH\n  sheet 3  UART         THE CONSOLE UART, ITS CLOCK, THE RS-232 DRIVER, THE DB9, THE TTL HEADER, THE UART'S -INT\n  sheet 4  Panel        THE SWITCHES, THE LEDS, THE TIL311 DISPLAYS, IN AND OUT\n  sheet 5  LCD          THE LCD MODULE\n  sheet 6  Clock        THE REAL-TIME CLOCK ON PORTS 6 AND 7\n  sheet 7  Power        POWER UNITS, DECOUPLING, POWER LED, THE SPARE GATES\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, and the local label at each pin names the net\n(/NAME, the names on the board). Above the dashed line: the nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left:\nit reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: the nets drawn on that sheet only, a pin on each side\n(KiCad's ERC counts a root label as connected only when another label of its name is on the root sheet).\nVCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e645e201-6a7a-5004-aa51-7546e4e600db"))
